------------
Captured on v7.2.0-rc3, x86_64, QEMU + dummy_hcd.

BUG: KASAN: slab-out-of-bounds in sierra_instat_callback+0x599/0x5d0
Read of size 1 at addr ffff888003dedf88 by task swapper/0/0

Call Trace:
